WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.080
Follow the lifecycle
from setup through cleanup.

00:00:02.240 --> 00:00:06.400
Pin and check the resources,
create isolated synthetic accounts,

00:00:06.440 --> 00:00:08.560
and configure the owned provider behavior.

00:00:08.710 --> 00:00:12.961
Execute the required tests
and challenge the deliberate fault.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:16.520
Retain assertions
and diagnostics before teardown.

00:00:16.585 --> 00:00:20.960
Attempt cleanup on both success
and failure, and escalate cleanup problems

00:00:21.013 --> 00:00:26.240
to the named owner. Finally, reconcile
separate provider integration evidence.

00:00:26.400 --> 00:00:31.200
The pipeline owns execution; AI may
help explain the retained results.
